==Acquisition== 
Diversified Denial is automatically acquired upon obtaining a [[Hound (Companion)|Hound]] built with the [[Bracket#Urga|Urga Bracket]].

==Notes==
*The Hound must be within ~40m of an enemy to activate.
*Cooldown of 15s.
*Other Precepts will not activate while specters are deployed.
*If all three specters are killed, the Hound will reappear with 50% Health.
**Specters cannot be healed with {{M|Pack Leader}}.
*Synergizes with {{M|Shattering Impact}} and {{Weapon|Batoten}} or {{Weapon|Lacerten}}, as each specter's attack reduces enemy armor.
*Cannot be equipped with {{M|Reflex Denial}} and {{M|Evasive Denial}}.

==Bugs==
*Cannot become invisible with abilities like [[Prowl]] unlike other companions, but enemies do not seem to notice them unless they attack if the invisible player attacks.

